 <section data-wbs-entry="tm-reg-wp-4">
 <h2>tm-reg-wp-4 Safe Public Inspector</h2>
-<p data-field="scope">What a public reader of the regular Catalog can do in the Inspector: every view of the Topic Maps readings and the Project Workspace is read-only on a public request; no view or button runs code, writes, loads a system, reads a secret or discloses a path of the host; the plain run buttons of the 22U reading, the CTM review and the readings are gated by the authority policy or absent from the public instance. Excluded: building the package (5); deploying it (6); the private staging Catalog reached through SSH; the content of the project work (3).</p>
