 <p data-field="acceptance">For each class of public route and view a recorded test shows that it is read-only; the plain run buttons are gated or absent on a public request; no request reaches the ASDF loader of a page-attached system; an independent security review of the public Inspector has been made and leaves no unresolved high finding.</p>
 <p data-field="authority">The user decides whether the package is accepted. An independent security review precedes the production decision; neither the executor's tests nor the review accept the package.</p>
 <p data-field="effect">Changes the authority policy and the public routes of the Catalog application and the reading systems' run buttons, and adds their tests. No server is touched.</p>
